# The full-stack machine: a gadget town that runs a FormalRV program.
# Generated by the town's own layout -- rows of places between streets, every door on a road --
# and judged by the floorplan rules F1-F9 like any other.
#
#   compute  two Pauli-product benches (ppm_d3): every PPM of the program, any product of one
#            X-bar or Z-bar from up to four blocks; a preparation place, a syndrome clinic and
#            two readouts
#   factory  two 15-to-1 factories (msf15), each beside a pharmacy (inj_d3): the T states a
#            pi/8 rotation consumes, and the |Y> blocks a pi/4 rotation consumes
#   memory   eight memories and a zone: a block waiting between measurements rests corrected
#   supply   two depots
#   control  the decoder and the classical memory, wired to every door that carries bits

floorplan fullstack_d3 "A machine for FormalRV programs (surface code, d = 3)"
code surface_d3

region supply
place depot1    depot9  at 0 11
place depot2    depot9  at 94 63

region compute
place prep      prep_d3 at 14 10
place clinic    se_d3   at 31 10
place bench1    ppm_d3  at 48 10
place post1     read_d3 at 83 10
place bench2    ppm_d3  at 49 36
place post2     read_d3 at 101 36

region memory
place mem1      mem_d3  at 94 10
place mem2      mem_d3  at 111 10
place mem3      mem_d3  at 32 36
place mem4      mem_d3  at 84 36
place mem5      mem_d3  at 112 36
place mem6      mem_d3  at 32 62
place mem7      mem_d3  at 49 62
place mem8      mem_d3  at 66 62
place zone1     zone_d3 at 83 62

region factory
place pharmacy1 inj_d3  at 0 36
place factory1  msf15   at 17 36
place pharmacy2 inj_d3  at 0 62
place factory2  msf15   at 17 62

region control
place decoder   dec_d3  at 2 98
place archive   arch1   at 24 98

# junctions: where roads meet
junction j0_0 at 0 0
junction j0_1 at 8 0
junction j0_2 at 14 0
junction j0_3 at 25 0
junction j0_4 at 31 0
junction j0_5 at 42 0
